WHAT THIS MOD SHIPS
-------------------

Only its own assemblies:

    KRPC.Bridge.Core.dll        + .xml
    KRPC.Bridge.Fmrs.dll        + .xml
    KRPC.Bridge.Ocisly.dll      + .xml
    KRPC.Bridge.MechJeb.dll     + .xml
    LICENSE, NOTICE, KRPC.Bridge.version

Nothing else. No kRPC assemblies, no KSP or Unity assemblies, and no files
belonging to any of the mods listed below. Everything is a dependency to be
installed separately, never a bundled copy.


kRPC - LINKED AGAINST
---------------------

KRPC.Bridge is compiled against KRPC.dll and KRPC.Core.dll, which are part of
kRPC.

    kRPC
    Copyright 2015-2023 kRPC Org
    Licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License v3.0 or later
    https://github.com/krpc/krpc

Those two assemblies come from kRPC's core/ and server/ directories, which the
project's LICENSE file places under the LGPL. (kRPC's GPLv3 carve-outs cover
service/SpaceCenter and the tooling directories; KRPC.Bridge references neither.)

Both are referenced with <Private>False</Private>, so no copy of either is ever
produced or distributed by this project. At run time KSP loads the copy already
present in the player's own GameData/kRPC folder. Any interface-compatible
build of kRPC may be substituted simply by replacing those files.


MODS REACHED BY REFLECTION - NOT LINKED, NOT REDISTRIBUTED
----------------------------------------------------------

KRPC.Bridge holds no compile-time reference to any of the following and
contains no code copied from them. It locates them at run time through KSP's
own AssemblyLoader and calls their public members by reflection. When a mod is
absent, its plugin reports available = false and everything else keeps working.

    FMRS Continued (Flight Manager for Reusable Stages)
    Copyright (c) 2015 SIT89, maintained by linuxgurugamer
    MIT License
    https://github.com/linuxgurugamer/FMRS

    MechJeb 2
    GNU General Public License v3.0
    https://github.com/MuMech/MechJeb2

    OfCourseIStillLoveYou (OCISLY)
    Copyright (c) Jesus Rodriguez Valencia
    https://github.com/jrodrigv/OfCourseIStillLoveYou
    Note: every released build ships a GPL-3.0 LICENSE file. The repository's
    root LICENSE was changed to MIT in April 2026, but no release has been cut
    under it, so treat the copy in your GameData as GPL-3.0.

    HullcamVDS Continued
    Maintained by linuxgurugamer
    GNU General Public License v3.0
    https://github.com/linuxgurugamer/HullcamVDSContinued

Thanks to their authors and maintainers. If you maintain one of these and would
rather KRPC.Bridge did not integrate with it, please open an issue and it will
be removed.


KERBAL SPACE PROGRAM
--------------------

Kerbal Space Program is a trademark of its respective owners. KRPC.Bridge is an
unofficial add-on, not affiliated with or endorsed by the developers or
publishers of the game.

The build compiles against Assembly-CSharp.dll, Assembly-CSharp-firstpass.dll
